From 1d18b435eb76645c911269e580e113ecc60790ff Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Marc <marc@schuetze.io>
Date: Tue, 7 Jul 2026 20:18:34 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 05/12] feat(mobile): slide-in session drawer (hamburger)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Adds a mobile-only left drawer that lists open sessions vertically,
toggled by a hamburger button in the header. Repurposes the existing
close-X, alert flashing all unchanged) and restyles it as the drawer
body via `body.session-drawer-open` in mobile.css.

- index.html: hamburger button (left of logo) + backdrop div placed
  OUTSIDE <header> so it escapes the header's stacking context
  (backdrop-filter + contain trap children at z-index 100).
- mobile.css: appended drawer block; overrides the horizontal-scroll
  tab rules under @media (max-width: 768px), two-class specificity to
  beat `.session-tabs.tabs-two-rows`.
- session-ui.js: toggle/open/closeSessionDrawer(); capture-phase tap
  handler dismisses the drawer on tab select (ignores gear/close-X).

All additive — additions anchored on stable upstream elements to keep
the patch update-safe across Codeman bumps.
---
 src/web/public/index.html    |  12 +++-
 src/web/public/mobile.css    | 105 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 src/web/public/session-ui.js |  72 ++++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 188 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

